<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank intervenes to prop up crown  - dealer.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank intervenes to prop up crown  - dealer.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech central bank, for the first time in almost one year, intervened directly on the market to support the crown, Petr Korous, a forex dealer at bank CSOB, told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;They have been in the market in the past few minutes, but the amounts have been quite small,&quot; he said, adding that as of 0735 GMT, he could no longer see the central bank on the market.</p>
</text>
